{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is a desktop pet?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back in ancient times, there was a type of computer software that showed a little character moving around your desktop. They were entertainingly annoying and very popular. This project aims to create a modern take on that genre by incorporating a touch of contemporary game logic into the characters, along with good visuals and physics-powered interactivity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features included</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full VRM support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aPhone: a rich and fun to use menu system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character creator</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3094870?t=1766848902","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3094870?t=1766848902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094870/d5edfa1d6ee6001df3ac75a34c37b96f840e911c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766848902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094870/d5edfa1d6ee6001df3ac75a34c37b96f840e911c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766848902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some outfits can be considered revealing. The base game does not contain nudity but it can be enabled through a DLC."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is a desktop pet?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back in ancient times, there was a type of computer software that showed a little character moving around your desktop. They were entertainingly annoying and very popular. This project aims to create a modern take on that genre by incorporating a touch of contemporary ga